{'symbol': 'HON', 'date': '2021-05-10 08:00:00', 'title': 'KUNSAN AIR BASE WORKS WITH HONEYWELL TO EXPAND ENERGY INFRASTRUCTURE UPGRADES', 'text': 'GUNSAN, SOUTH KOREA, MAY 10, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0HONEYWELL (NYSE: HON) ANNOUNCED TODAY IT IS STARTING THE NEXT PHASE OF AN INFRASTRUCTURE MODERNIZATION PROJECT TO IMPROVE ENERGY RESILIENCY AT KUNSAN AIR BASE, A U.S. AIR FORCE BASE IN GUNSAN, SOUTH KOREA. THE $23 MILLION PROJECT WILL IMPROVE FUEL SUPPLY RELIABILITY THROUGH THE INSTALLATION OF NATURAL GAS SERVICE ON THE BASE.'}